<section class="court-perspectives-section" style="background-color: #08080a; padding: 80px 24px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); color: #ffffff; font-family: monospace;">
  <div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; md-flex-direction: row; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 48px;">
      <div>
        <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; background: #121318; border: 1px solid rgba(204,255,0,0.3); padding: 4px 14px; border-radius: 999px; color: #ccff00; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 12px;">
          <span>★ FIELD TESTED BY TOUR ATHLETES</span>
        </div>
        <h2 style="font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: -1px; margin: 0 0 8px 0; color: #ffffff;">
          CUSTOMER PERSPECTIVES
        </h2>
        <p style="color: #a1a1aa; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 14px; max-width: 600px; margin: 0;">
          Real telemetry feedback from PPA tour pros, D1 champions, and master coaches competing in high-velocity court conditions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; background: #121318; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 12px;">
        <span style="font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 900; color: #ccff00;">4.98</span>
        <div>
          <div style="color: #ccff00; font-size: 12px;">★★★★★</div>
          <div style="font-size: 10px; color: #a1a1aa; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: bold;">1,420+ Verified Reviews</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Testimonials Grid -->
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 24px;">
      
      <!-- Testimonial 1 -->
      <div style="background: #121318; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
        <div>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
            <div style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 10px; background: #222; border: 1px solid #ccff00; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: bold; color: #ccff00;">MV</div>
            <div>
              <div style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff;">Marcus "Vapor" Vance</div>
              <div style="font-size: 11px; color: #ccff00;">PPA Tour Pro (UTPR 5.4)</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="color: #ccff00; font-size: 11px; margin-bottom: 12px;">★★★★★ VERIFIED</div>
          <p style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #d4d4d8; line-height: 1.6; font-style: italic; border-left: 2px solid #ccff00; padding-left: 12px; margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
            "The 0.18 Cd drag coefficient isn't just marketing—in 95°F tournament conditions, the active cooling micro-vents prevent thermal stickiness during quick kitchen re-resets."
          </p>
        </div>
        <div style="border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); pt: 12px; font-size: 10px; color: #a1a1aa; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding-top: 12px;">
          <span>GEAR: Kinetic Court Tee</span>
          <span style="color: #ccff00; font-weight: bold;">-14% DRAG</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial 2 -->
      <div style="background: #121318; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
        <div>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
            <div style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 10px; background: #222; border: 1px solid #ccff00; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: bold; color: #ccff00;">ER</div>
            <div>
              <div style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff;">Elena Rostova</div>
              <div style="font-size: 11px; color: #ccff00;">D1 Tennis Champion</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="color: #ccff00; font-size: 11px; margin-bottom: 12px;">★★★★★ VERIFIED</div>
          <p style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #d4d4d8; line-height: 1.6; font-style: italic; border-left: 2px solid #ccff00; padding-left: 12px; margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
            "Zero chafing after 5 consecutive 3-set tournament matches. The 4-way kinetic stretch retains shape and compression even after 40+ high-temp wash cycles."
          </p>
        </div>
        <div style="border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); font-size: 10px; color: #a1a1aa; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding-top: 12px;">
          <span>GEAR: Court Compression Short</span>
          <span style="color: #ccff00; font-weight: bold;">-3.2°C COOLING</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial 3 -->
      <div style="background: #121318; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
        <div>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
            <div style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 10px; background: #222; border: 1px solid #ccff00; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: bold; color: #ccff00;">DC</div>
            <div>
              <div style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff;">David Chen</div>
              <div style="font-size: 11px; color: #ccff00;">Master Director (USAPA)</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="color: #ccff00; font-size: 11px; margin-bottom: 12px;">★★★★★ VERIFIED</div>
          <p style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #d4d4d8; line-height: 1.6; font-style: italic; border-left: 2px solid #ccff00; padding-left: 12px; margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
            "The silver-ion antimicrobial weave completely eliminates tournament bag odor. The precision ergonomic tailoring fits like a second skin without restricting overhead smashes."
          </p>
        </div>
        <div style="border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); font-size: 10px; color: #a1a1aa; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding-top: 12px;">
          <span>GEAR: Vapor Micro-Mesh Jersey</span>
          <span style="color: #ccff00; font-weight: bold;">99.8% ODOR SHIELD</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Testimonial 4 -->
      <div style="background: #121318; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 16px; padding: 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between;">
        <div>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
            <div style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 10px; background: #222; border: 1px solid #ccff00; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: bold; color: #ccff00;">ST</div>
            <div>
              <div style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; color: #ffffff;">Sydnie Thorne</div>
              <div style="font-size: 11px; color: #ccff00;">National Singles Finalist</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="color: #ccff00; font-size: 11px; margin-bottom: 12px;">★★★★★ VERIFIED</div>
          <p style="font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #d4d4d8; line-height: 1.6; font-style: italic; border-left: 2px solid #ccff00; padding-left: 12px; margin: 0 0 16px 0;">
            "I was skeptical until I took it through the 30-Day Court Test. The moisture dispersal rate is instant. You step off court feeling completely dry and calibrated."
          </p>
        </div>
        <div style="border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); font-size: 10px; color: #a1a1aa; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding-top: 12px;">
          <span>GEAR: Court Performance Hoodie</span>
          <span style="color: #ccff00; font-weight: bold;">0.4s SWEAT DISPERSAL</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Customer Perspectives",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
